00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:28.800
It's a bit of a... it's a bit of a 'chicken before the egg' kind of question to ask yourself

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:35.560
because you can't have any self doubts if you haven't already imposed a limit on yourself and

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:43.060
The thing about a YouTube "career" is that when I was pursuing it it was not going to be my "career"

00:10:43.129 --> 00:10:45.428
