00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:30.219
I realized that I had so much to learn. And instead of allowing that to be a daunting fact

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.489
I just took that into myself and I realized

00:11:33.979 --> 00:11:37.028
I have every day to try to learn a new thing

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:45.020
I have every day to try to learn more about this craft and make it into something great without worrying about

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:50.040
making money or making it my career or making it the thing that I was going to do all my life because

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:55.840
YouTube in and of itself is only a means by which to create.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.600
And creation, is the thing that is fulfilling your life.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:09.300
